                                                      &lt;li&gt;=0A              =
                                                      &lt;p&gt;Then, download the=
 printer driver from the official page.=0A                                 =
                                   &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                 =
                               &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                    =
                            &lt;li&gt;=0A                                        =
                            &lt;p&gt;Next, double-tap the downloaded file.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=
                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A   =
                                                             &lt;li&gt;=0A       =
                                                             &lt;p&gt;Now, you ha=
ve to complete the installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                              =
                                  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                 =
                               &lt;li&gt;=0A                                     =
                               &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.=
&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;/li=
&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A=
                                                                    &lt;p&gt;Next=
, the Run dialogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                   =
                             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                      =
                          &lt;li&gt;=0A                                          =
                          &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.Dev=
icesAndPrinters.=E2=80=9D=0A                                               =
                     &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                               =
                 &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                      =
              &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                   =
