                                          &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers=
 folder will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                  =
              &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                     =
           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                         =
           &lt;p&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A    =
