printer to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                    =
                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                       =
                         &lt;li&gt;=0A                                           =
                         &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the p=
rinter=0A                                                                  =
      driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                       =
         &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                          =
      &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                              =
      &lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A            =
